# Alice and Bob are people, but Bob has a recorded block.
# Only Alice receives a fresh record, showing explicit absence tests and
# existential witnesses in Logical English compiled to ordinary LS.

Alice is a person.
Bob is a person.
Bob is blocked.

# Absence is tested after the person fact has supplied X.
# The same witness Y is shared by the record type and its ownership link.
For every X, if X is a person and it is not known that X is blocked
then there exists Y such that Y is a record and X is an owner of Y.

Find every X and Y such that X is an owner of Y.
